config FWUAL_MCUBOOT_IMAGE_COUNT
    int "Number of MCUboot updateable images"
    default 1
    help
      Number of independently updateable firmware images managed by
      the FWUAL MCUboot backend. Must match MCUboot's
      CONFIG_UPDATEABLE_IMAGE_NUMBER.